t,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">小米新款人形机器人亮相投资者日:已进厂实测，复杂安装成功率超90%</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">不做AI产品做AI增强：Ubuntu官宣 2026 年全面集成原生AI</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI联手联发科、高通及立讯精密研发去应用化AI手机</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">爆火的DeepSeek-V4 背后：北大开源框架One-Eval如何终结AI测评“噩梦”？</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a9d6ed61bca0e37f74e8e69b006cbedb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">爆火的DeepSeek-V4 背后：北大开源框架One-Eval如何终结AI测评“噩梦”。AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Apr 28, 202620DeepSeek-V4 发布仅 10 小时，北京大学DCAI团队便火速出炉了一份全量自动化评测报告。这一速度在AI工程界引发了广泛关注，其核心推手是北大最新开源的评测框架——One-Eval。长期以来，大模型评测被视为工程师的“噩梦”。传统流程中，从筛选基准集、编写脚本、字段适配到解析运行日志，大量精力消耗在搭建测试管道而非模型跑分本身。One-Eval的出现，标志着行业效率进入了范式级的提升阶段。传统评测的困局：黑盒与污染当前大模型评测正面临严峻挑战。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软与OpenAI修订合作协议：独占授权终结并停止支付营收分成</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e2ab3ef4ec8c64bb0f52cf5c4949163e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软与OpenAI正式修订合作协议，将此前对OpenAI模型及产品的“独占式”授权变更为“非独占式”，有效期持续至2032年。此次调整后，OpenAI获得完全自主权，可自由选择云服务商提供全线产品。在合作架构上，微软仍保持OpenAI首要云服务合作伙伴地位，OpenAI新产品将优先在Azure上线，双方在数据中心与芯片研发领域的合作保持不变。财务层面，微软将停止向OpenAI支付营收分成，而OpenAI向微软支付的分成将持续至2030年并设有总额上限。此次协议修订理顺了双方的运营细则，在保留微软主要股东权益的同时，赋予了OpenAI更广阔的独立市场拓展空间，标志着双方从深度捆绑向更具灵活性的战略伙伴关系转型。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">小米新款人形机器人亮相投资者日:已进厂实测，复杂安装成功率超90%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e048fcb66d7a040b511bc71fca6d951b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">小米新款人形机器人亮相投资者日:已进厂实测，复杂安装成功率超90%AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Apr 28, 2026304月27日，小米在投资者大会上低调展示了研发四年的新款全尺寸人形机器人，标志着其具身智能技术从实验室演示迈向工厂实操阶段。继2021年四足机器人“铁蛋”与2022年首款人形机器人“铁大”发布后，小米在机器人领域保持了长达四年的低调研发，此次展示直接跳过常规发布会，以现场分发伴手礼及打招呼等高难度灵巧交互形式宣告回归。技术层面，新款机器人展示了极强的感知与执行能力，能够精准识别并抓取纸袋提手等细微目标。目前，该款机器人已在小米汽车工厂实现连续自主作业3小时，面对复杂的零部件安装任务，其安装成功率突破90%。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">不做AI产品做AI增强：Ubuntu官宣 2026 年全面集成原生AI</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/02d0e5bc0eee406f46b47a0407cfff04.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">不做AI产品做AI增强：Ubuntu官宣 2026 年全面集成原生AIAIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Apr 28, 202616随着Ubuntu 26.04 LTS版本的发布，Canonical公司正式宣布了下一阶段的发展重点。工程副总裁Jon Seager近期明确指出，Ubuntu将在未来一年内陆续引入大量AI功能，旨在构建一个具备情境感知的智能操作系统。官方强调，Ubuntu并非要转型为一款纯粹的AI产品。相反，其核心策略是通过深思熟虑的集成，利用AI技术让现有的桌面和服务器系统变得更加强大。本地推理与智能工作流 在技术实现上，新系统将默认侧重于本地推理。这种设计不仅能够保障用户的数据安全与隐私，同时也符合开源社区一贯的核心价值观。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI联手联发科、高通及立讯精密研发去应用化AI手机</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/40228632a3893ece841b3cb4f05c2fbb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正与联发科、高通及立讯精密合作研发一款颠覆性智能手机，旨在通过“AI Agent”彻底取代传统App生态。该设备核心逻辑在于利用AI代理理解用户上下文，并根据任务复杂度灵活调配端侧模型与云端大模型资源。目前，该项目处于联合设计阶段，预计2026年底至2027年第一季度敲定规格，最早于2028年量产。此举标志着OpenAI试图从底层硬件重构移动终端交互逻辑。此外，OpenAI首款硬件产品（推测为智能耳塞）预计将于2026年下半年发布，显示其正加速从软件生态向物理终端延伸的战略布局。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
